\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class="form-group col-md-2">\r\n                        <label for="storage_path" data-toggle="tooltip" title="图片的分类目录<br>更改会导致广场无法使用<br>非必要不要修改,末尾需要加'/' <br />PHP date() 函数参考">存储分类路径 <a href="https://www.runoob.com/php/php-date.html" target="_blank"><i class="icon icon-external-link"></i></a></label>\r\n                        <input type="text" class="form-control" name="storage_path" required="required" value="" onkeyup="this.value=this.value.replace(/\\s/g,'')" title="参考PHP date() 函数">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <!-- <div class="form-group">\r\n                    <label data-toggle="tooltip" title="不懂就不要改本图床仅针对图片上传,如果想上传其他类型文件请更改此出,不同mime请以英文,分割">允许的MIME类型</label>\r\n                    <input type="text" class="form-control" name="mime" required="required" value="php echo $config['mime'];" onkeyup="this.value=this.value.replace(/\\s/g,'')">\r\n                    </div> -->\r\n                    <div class="form-group col-md-3">\r\n                        <label data-toggle="tooltip" title="请以英文 , 分割 最后一个不加 , <br/>非图片格式需在图床安全中关闭图床模式">允许的扩展名 | 非图片格式?</label>\r\n                        <input type="text" class="form-control" name="extensions" required="required" value="" onkeyup="this.value=this.value.replace(/\\s/g,'')">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class="form-group col-md-2">\r\n                        <label>上传文件的命名方式</label>\r\n                        <select class="chosen-select form-control" name="imgName">\r\n                            <option value="default" selected>默认 - 36进制时间+随机数 >> vx77yu</option>\r\n                            <option value="date" selected>时间 >> 192704</option>\r\n                            <option value="unix" selected>Unix >> 1635074840</option>\r\n                            <option value="crc32" selected>CRC32 >> 2495551279</option>\r\n                            <option value="uniqid" selected>微秒 >> 6175436c73418</option>\r\n                            <option value="snowflake" selected>雪花 >> 5357520647037653166</option>\r\n                            <option value="source" selected>源名 >> 微信图片_20211228214754</option>\r\n                            <option value="md5" selected>MD5 >> 3888aa69eb321a2b61fcc63520bf6c82</option>\r\n                            <option value="sha1" selected>SHA1 >> 654faac01499e0cb5fb0e9d78b21e234c63d842a</option>\r\n                            <option value="uuid" selected>通用唯一识别码 >> 668ab647-c874-51e8-cc98-ac5c24a472b0</option>\r\n                            <option value="guid" selected>全局唯一标识符 >> 6EDAD0CC-AB0C-4F61-BCCA-05FAD65BF0FA</option>\r\n                        </select>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class="form-group col-md-2">\r\n                        <label data-toggle="tooltip" title="支持图片转换格式后压缩,压缩率与 上传压缩->后端压缩率关联<br />不建议同时启用后端压缩,避免重复压缩导致图片变大"> * 将上传图片转换格式</label>\r\n                        <select class="chosen-select form-control" name="imgConvert">\r\n                            <option value="" selected>不转换</option>\r\n                            <option value="webp" selected>WEBP</option>\r\n                            <option value="png" selected>PNG</option>\r\n                            <option value="jpeg" selected>JPG</option>\r\n                            <option value="gif" selected>GIF</option>\r\n                            <option value="bmp" selected>BMP</option>\r\n                        </select>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class="form-group col-md-2">\r\n                        <label for="chunks" data-toggle="tooltip" title="开启分片后粘贴上传失效<br/>可能使部分文件上传失败<br/>建议最小1Mb(1048576字节)">分片上传 | 设置<code>0</code>关闭</label>\r\n                        <div class="input-group">\r\n                            <input type="number" min="0" class="form-control" id="chunks" name="chunks" required="required" value="" onkeyup="this.value=this.value.replace(/\\s/g,'')">\r\n 